        <a href="/window-tint-pricing"><span class="vehicle-coverage__type">Compare packages</span><h3>Know the scope.</h3><p>See the current service menu. Ask separately about existing-film removal and additional glass.</p><span class="vehicle-text-link">View pricing <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></span></a>
      </div><div class="vehicle-coverage-help"><p>Not sure which windows to choose? <strong>Let's work it out for your 4Runner.</strong></p><a class="vehicle-text-link" href="sms:+17146007134?body=Hi%20Obsidian%2C%20I&#39;d%20like%20a%20window%20tint%20quote%20for%20my%20Toyota%204Runner.%20Year%3A%20__.%20City%3A%20__.%20Windows%20to%20tint%3A%20__." data-lead-action="vehicle_coverage_text">Text us about your 4Runner <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="vehicle-band" id="your-vehicle"><div class="vehicle-shell vehicle-detail"><div><p class="vehicle-kicker">Made for your 4Runner</p><h2>Look at the whole vehicle. Quote each part.</h2><p>Before picking a shade, share the year, existing film, and the windows you want treated. The rear-window configuration and any factory-darkened glass need to be considered as part of your specific vehicle, not a generic SUV package.</p><a class="vehicle-text-link" href="/ceramic-window-tinting">Explore ceramic window film <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div><dl class="vehicle-checks"><div><dt>Model generation</dt><dd>Send the year so the discussion starts with the right 4Runner.</dd></div><div><dt>Back-window configuration</dt><dd>Include a clear rear-glass photo and mention how the window operates.</dd></div><div><dt>Your coverage goal</dt><dd>Clarify whether you want the front two windows or a broader package, and flag any existing film.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
    <section class="vehicle-band vehicle-band--silver" id="mobile"><div class="vehicle-shell vehicle-mobile"><div><p class="vehicle-kicker">Your car. Your location.</p><h2>Less waiting room.<br>More of your day.</h2></div><div><p>Ask about mobile installation at a suitable home or workplace in Orange County. Share your city and the space available around the vehicle so access and conditions can be confirmed before scheduling.</p><div class="vehicle-local-links"><a href="/irvine-window-tinting">Irvine</a><a href="/newport-beach-window-tinting">Newport Beach</a><a href="/costa-mesa-window-tinting">Costa Mesa</a><a href="/lake-forest-window-tinting">Lake Forest</a></div><a class="vehicle-text-link" href="/mobile-window-tinting">About mobile service <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="vehicle-band vehicle-band--light" id="questions"><div class="vehicle-shell vehicle-faq-layout"><div><p class="vehicle-kicker">Before the appointment</p><h2>A few good<br>questions.</h2><p>Keep the decisions specific to your vehicle.</p></div><div class="vehicle-faq"><details><summary>What information matters for a 4Runner quote?</summary><p>The model year, requested windows, existing film, and a photo of the rear glass. Include your city and available install space for a mobile appointment.</p></details><details><summary>Can I choose front-only coverage?</summary><p>Compare the front-two-window service with the sides-and-rear package. Obsidian will confirm what is included for your 4Runner before the appointment.</p></details><details><summary>What if I do not know whether the rear glass has film?</summary><p>Say that when requesting the quote and send clear photos. Do not assume darker glass means a particular film has already been installed.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I check tint rules and aftercare?</summary><p>Read the <a href="/california-window-tint-law">California tint guide</a> before selecting coverage, and the <a href="/window-tint-aftercare">aftercare guide</a> before your appointment. Confirm the selected film and care instructions directly with Obsidian.</p></details></div></div></section>
